<section id="other-extensions" class="level1">
<h1>Other extensions</h1>
<p>See—we told you extensions to ggplot2 would be easy – right? For other ggplot2 extensions that folks have created, check out the <a href="https://exts.ggplot2.tidyverse.org/gallery/">ggplot2 extensions gallery</a>, which includes extensions such as <a href="https://github.com/haleyjeppson/ggmosaic"><code>{ggmosaic}</code></a>, <a href="https://heike.github.io/ggpcp/"><code>{ggpcp}</code></a>, and <a href="https://github.com/slowkow/ggrepel"><code>{ggrepel}</code></a> just to name a few!</p>


</section>

 ]]></description>
